## 1. High-Level Executive Overview
Phase 02 delivers the machine-mode reset handler, hardware register sanitization, and privileged exception dispatch pipeline for the THEJAS32 SoC (VEGA ET1031 core) in `src/platform/ARIES/startup.S`. It establishes full 31-GPR sanitization, guarantees strict 16-byte stack alignment, aligns the trap vector to a 64-byte boundary, preserves the pre-trap stack pointer in frame[2], and bypasses redundant in-SRAM .data copy.

